# S: post-flash smoke hover, the first flight after every reflash. One flash bundles ~15 firmware commits
# (exp latch, landing xy hold 868f4ba4, drift NN shadow task + live switch, x/y and Z MRAC rows), so this
# 30 s hover proves the new build arms, holds, logs the drift net in shadow (g_drift_nn_live=0) and lands
# with the new landing hold (pad gate 10 cm, the mem flights' setting) before any experiment flies on it.
# Fly it: fly lab_s_smoke --once (camera fusion mode 3). Pass (PROPOSED): steady hover; drift_nn.steps passes
# 125 with live_on 0; camera landing line inside the 10 cm pad gate (10-19 landings were 17-41 cm off).
campaign lab-s-smoke
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
slow 50 drift_nn nn4 xy_ctrl ekf_states estimator_truth takeoff_gate
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10 g_drift_nn_live=0
takeoff 0.8
hold 30
land
